    {
      "shape_id": 9,
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Descartes proposed a radical solution to the mind-body problem: Dualism. He argued the body is a machine following physical laws, while the mind is a non-material entity. This allowed scientists to ignore the \"soul\" and study the brain as a biological machine.",
      "alt_text": "Text 6",
